WEBVTT

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

01:57.210 --> 02:00.880
Man, this is bad, the sky's about to open up.

02:00.880 --> 02:03.490
I'd better high-tail it home!

02:05.850 --> 02:08.030
S..Sorry.

02:20.340 --> 02:23.570
A man completely covered in bandages?

02:23.570 --> 02:26.840
I have a bad feeling about this.

02:26.840 --> 02:31.350
Could he be an assassin after Hime's life?

02:34.420 --> 02:37.420
It's starting!

02:42.990 --> 02:46.440
Man, I'm soaked.

02:47.430 --> 02:49.060
I'm back!

02:49.060 --> 02:51.410
Welcome home, Hiro.

02:53.440 --> 02:57.170
What's the matter, Sis?
Did you catch a cold?

02:57.170 --> 02:58.570
I think so.

02:58.570 --> 03:01.440
I've had a fever since this morning
and I've been feeling dizzy.

03:01.440 --> 03:03.240
Are you all right?

03:03.250 --> 03:06.110
I think I'll be fine with some rest.

03:06.110 --> 03:08.420
But good timing.

03:08.420 --> 03:11.250
I just received a phone call from the Mistress.

03:11.250 --> 03:16.160
Can you go bring her an umbrella?
She's waiting out the rain at the station.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.790
You got it.

03:17.790 --> 03:20.930
And can you buy me some cold medicine?

03:20.930 --> 03:21.860
Sure.

03:21.860 --> 03:23.800
And also...

03:23.800 --> 03:26.830
What? A strawberry parfait?!

03:26.840 --> 03:31.140
The parfaits at that shop I go to
all the time are so good!

03:31.140 --> 03:33.440
I'm sure I'll feel better if I have one.

03:33.440 --> 03:35.290
Okay? Please!

03:36.680 --> 03:41.020
She almost never catches a cold.

03:44.550 --> 03:47.560
Is this the parfait shop?

03:47.560 --> 03:49.540
I'll stop by on the way back.

04:00.700 --> 04:03.300
That's the man I bumped into
on the way home from school.

04:03.310 --> 04:05.380
Hey, Hiro!

04:07.310 --> 04:09.310
Princess Sherwood!

04:11.180 --> 04:12.880
What great timing! Come with me for a bit.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.620
Hey! Where are you taking me?

04:14.620 --> 04:16.890
Welcome to Sasanaki Shopping District

04:17.420 --> 04:21.590
I've always wanted to play in here!

04:21.590 --> 04:23.540
An arcade?

04:24.160 --> 04:25.960
You'll join me, won't you?

04:25.960 --> 04:30.960
Huh? B..But I have to go and pick up Hime.

04:31.200 --> 04:32.200
Hime?

04:32.200 --> 04:33.200
What?!

04:33.200 --> 04:38.200
So, you'll follow my sister's orders and not mine?

04:38.540 --> 04:41.840
No! Th..That's not what I meant.

04:41.840 --> 04:43.680
Francesca!

04:43.680 --> 04:45.320
Huga.

04:47.750 --> 04:49.880
Hiro's late.

04:49.890 --> 04:51.520
Huga.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.830
Huga, huga, huga.

04:57.360 --> 04:59.860
Hiro, what are you just standing there for?

04:59.860 --> 05:02.200
Give it a shot, it's a lot of fun!

05:02.200 --> 05:03.360
B..But...

05:03.370 --> 05:05.900
Stay with me all day today, okay?

05:05.900 --> 05:07.850
What?!

05:11.740 --> 05:15.010
What the heck is Hiro doing?

05:15.010 --> 05:16.650
Huga.

05:21.220 --> 05:25.020
Geez, Princess Sherwood doesn't
listen to reason at all.

05:25.020 --> 05:27.730
Sasanaki Station

05:34.730 --> 05:36.760
I guess there's no way she'd still be here.

05:36.770 --> 05:41.010
The rain stopped and I'm over an hour late.

05:45.410 --> 05:46.840
Oh, it's Hiro.

05:46.840 --> 05:48.480
Hey...

05:49.980 --> 05:52.120
A mummy-man?

05:56.650 --> 05:59.130
He's following Hiro.

06:00.560 --> 06:03.630
This might get interesting.

06:18.710 --> 06:23.380
What?! Y..You walked home in the rain?!

06:26.580 --> 06:28.620
Hold on, Flandre.

06:29.050 --> 06:31.890
Do you understand the concept of excess?

06:33.660 --> 06:37.970
Geez, no need to go so crazy over a little cold.

06:38.760 --> 06:40.400
Huga!

06:40.900 --> 06:43.470
I said enough!

06:44.930 --> 06:49.840
I'm sorry, if only Princess Sherwood
hadn't spotted me...

06:49.840 --> 06:55.650
It's fine; all the apologies in the world
won't help me get over this cold.

06:56.210 --> 06:57.920
Say, Hiro...

06:58.110 --> 07:00.010
Oh, Sis!

07:00.020 --> 07:01.480
Where's my medicine?

07:01.480 --> 07:04.450
Oh damn! I totally forgot!

07:04.450 --> 07:07.150
What? Then, what about the parfait?

07:07.160 --> 07:08.460
I'm sorry.

07:08.460 --> 07:10.220
No way!

07:10.230 --> 07:13.540
Sis, no need to overreact.

07:13.960 --> 07:16.500
Hey, get up!

07:16.500 --> 07:17.500
Oh man, you've got a serious fever going!

07:18.500 --> 07:20.800
I'll go buy you some medicine right now!

07:20.800 --> 07:23.940
Umm, I'll get some for you too, Hime.

07:28.440 --> 07:31.480
I totally forgot about my sister.

07:38.920 --> 07:43.790
"We had to close early today due
to special circumstances."

07:43.790 --> 07:48.790
What should I do?
This is the only drug store in town.

07:48.860 --> 07:51.900
What are you doing standing there, Hiro?

07:53.000 --> 07:55.470
You've been playing arcade games
this whole time?

07:55.470 --> 07:58.210
Yeah, it was a blast!

07:58.210 --> 08:00.040
I'm totally addicted now.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.280
Huga.

08:01.710 --> 08:05.280
What? Both my sister and Sawawa caught colds?

08:05.280 --> 08:10.280
Hime had to walk home in the rain
while we were in the arcade.

08:10.820 --> 08:13.790
I see, I feel bad about that then.

08:13.790 --> 08:18.070
In that case, have them drink
these special ampoules.

08:18.660 --> 08:21.060
They work really well.

08:21.060 --> 08:22.330
B..But...

08:22.330 --> 08:27.330
Don't worry, my sister has been drinking
this special medicine since she was a kid.

08:27.900 --> 08:33.480
In return, the next time we play video games,
you have to stay with me the entire time.

08:41.420 --> 08:43.690
It's so good.

08:44.350 --> 08:46.350
Thank you, Hiro.

08:46.350 --> 08:48.360
Take your medicine, too.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.990
Right!

08:57.070 --> 09:00.330
Hiro, did Sawawa take her medicine already?

09:00.340 --> 09:02.340
She did and now she's asleep.

09:02.570 --> 09:07.570
I see, this special medicine makes you drowsy
but as Sherwood said, it's very effective.

09:08.210 --> 09:10.910
She should be all better by tomorrow morning.

09:10.910 --> 09:14.160
You seem to be taking it easy, huh?

09:16.220 --> 09:18.350
Nice to see you again, Princess.

09:18.350 --> 09:20.390
Reiri!

09:20.860 --> 09:22.990
Hime, how do you feel?

09:22.990 --> 09:25.930
You! What are you doing here?!

09:25.930 --> 09:29.530
I see your tastes haven't improved at all, Princess.

09:29.530 --> 09:32.200
To think you'd let that beast wander
freely in your home...

09:32.200 --> 09:33.470
What did you say?!

09:33.470 --> 09:35.370
There's a crescent moon out tonight.

09:35.370 --> 09:38.110
Reiri, what are you planning to do?

09:38.110 --> 09:41.880
Why, nothing at all!
I'm just here to observe.

09:41.880 --> 09:43.210
Observe?

09:43.210 --> 09:48.210
Yes, a group of mummies will come
attacking this mansion shortly.

09:48.380 --> 09:52.250
I'm sure it will be an event worth watching.

09:52.250 --> 09:54.390
What? Mummies?

09:54.960 --> 09:59.960
Yes, a mummy-man followed Hiro
all the way to this mansion.

10:01.230 --> 10:03.330
A mummy-man?

10:03.330 --> 10:07.110
Though it seems Hiro didn't realize
he was being followed.

10:13.370 --> 10:17.850
So, the man I bumped into today on
the way home from school, he...

10:17.850 --> 10:19.350
So, they're coming.

10:19.350 --> 10:20.990
They?

10:28.360 --> 10:30.260
They're here...

10:30.260 --> 10:32.830
...the Pharaoh's army.

10:47.280 --> 10:51.040
Hime, I have no grudge against you,

10:51.050 --> 10:53.620
but I'll need you to die for me.

10:57.190 --> 10:58.350
Wh..What?

10:58.350 --> 10:59.990
Huga.

11:05.460 --> 11:07.270
All right...

11:07.800 --> 11:10.710
I'm going to enjoy watching this.

11:30.550 --> 11:34.250
Pharaoh, I don't know which one
of my siblings revived you,

11:34.260 --> 11:38.530
but I didn't think you had
unfinished business in this world.

11:38.530 --> 11:43.530
You cannot understand the frustration
of having to rest for four thousand years,

11:45.900 --> 11:49.640
but I've finally been given my chance.

11:49.640 --> 11:54.640
I've been promised eternal life if I take your life!

11:55.180 --> 11:57.380
Now, let the banquet begin.

11:57.380 --> 11:59.290
Prepare to die!

12:01.620 --> 12:03.320
Try this on for size!

12:04.550 --> 12:06.330
Take this!

12:28.740 --> 12:30.380
Huga!

12:34.050 --> 12:37.080
Flandre, no Molotov cocktails indoors, please.

12:37.090 --> 12:38.720
Huga.

12:40.360 --> 12:44.000
Man, these guys aren't tough at all.

12:47.300 --> 12:50.430
The only problem is their numbers.

12:50.430 --> 12:52.130
Hime?

12:52.130 --> 12:54.370
The medicine is taking effect.

13:05.250 --> 13:07.050
Listen closely, Hiro.

13:07.050 --> 13:09.220
I'm going to sleep now.

13:10.080 --> 13:14.790
Sleep? In the middle of battle?

13:15.720 --> 13:19.800
Listen, Hiro, you are a royal soldier.

13:20.460 --> 13:25.880
My life is in your hands until morning.

13:28.900 --> 13:30.750
Hime...

13:41.950 --> 13:44.050
I understand, Hime.

13:44.050 --> 13:47.950
Hime, I will protect you!

13:47.960 --> 13:50.460
Huga!

13:55.530 --> 13:57.660
Damn, there's no end in sight.

13:57.670 --> 13:58.730
Huga.

13:58.730 --> 14:00.370
Hiro, where's Sawawa?

14:01.440 --> 14:02.440
Sis!

14:02.440 --> 14:04.250
Hey, Hiro!

14:10.810 --> 14:12.450
Sis!

14:14.180 --> 14:16.890
Sis, wake up! Sis!

14:17.920 --> 14:20.190
Another parfait, please...

14:20.190 --> 14:22.070
Sis!

14:26.790 --> 14:28.570
What should I do?

14:37.510 --> 14:40.510
An extra-large parfait, please...

14:40.510 --> 14:42.350
Over here!

14:44.510 --> 14:47.890
Ah, it's so good!

14:49.720 --> 14:51.990
My sister is fighting a group of mummies?

14:51.990 --> 14:56.220
Yes, they're in the middle of
a life-or-death battle right now.

14:56.220 --> 15:01.190
And you, a vampire, came
all the way here to tell me this?

15:01.200 --> 15:03.130
I have no ulterior motive.

15:03.130 --> 15:07.900
However, from a spectator's standpoint,
don't you think the more the merrier?

15:07.900 --> 15:10.170
That's all.

15:10.170 --> 15:11.980
I'll be going now.

15:13.170 --> 15:15.540
The least she could do is close the window.

15:15.540 --> 15:16.640
Geez...

15:16.640 --> 15:17.640
Huga.

15:17.650 --> 15:23.060
They're probably having their run of the place
with my sister asleep, though.

15:24.020 --> 15:25.920
Let's go, Francesca.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.560
Huga.

15:34.460 --> 15:36.100
Hiro!

15:43.100 --> 15:46.640
This is an all-out fight for survival now.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.450
Take that!

15:58.450 --> 16:00.430
Huga!

16:04.990 --> 16:07.060
H..Hime!

16:13.170 --> 16:14.810
Hiro...

16:17.340 --> 16:19.110
Huga.

16:19.110 --> 16:20.740
Hiro!

16:24.410 --> 16:26.080
My beloved Hiro...

16:26.080 --> 16:27.450
That's it!

16:27.450 --> 16:29.090
Francesca!

16:32.420 --> 16:35.160
I'll have enough mummy scraps to last a lifetime!

16:35.160 --> 16:36.790
Huga.

16:55.180 --> 16:58.650
Causing me all this trouble...

17:09.060 --> 17:11.870
That's the last of them.

17:39.790 --> 17:40.920
Now you run out of battery power?!

17:40.920 --> 17:44.670
Damn, the little one is really useless.

17:48.100 --> 17:49.730
Huga.

17:54.800 --> 17:58.680
Pharaoh, it's my turn now.

18:20.490 --> 18:22.570
What stubborn bastards.

18:23.730 --> 18:25.370
Huga...

18:28.240 --> 18:30.440
You too, Francesca?!

18:30.440 --> 18:34.510
Wait right there, I'll bring you a
disposable battery recharger.

18:50.360 --> 18:52.990
L..Liza!

18:52.990 --> 18:56.570
It's no good, I can't move any more.

19:01.770 --> 19:04.340
That's enough, Pharaoh.

19:06.940 --> 19:11.440
Well, Pharaoh, now I'll send
you back to the afterlife.

19:11.450 --> 19:14.650
This time, you'll rest for all eternity.

19:14.650 --> 19:16.860
H..Hime...

19:22.190 --> 19:24.140
Prepare to die!

19:49.720 --> 19:54.170
It was a long fight, but certainly worth watching.

19:54.890 --> 19:58.390
I guess it's time to go home and sleep.

19:59.130 --> 20:00.760
Hiro...

20:02.460 --> 20:06.410
You did well, I'm proud of you.

20:10.100 --> 20:12.020
Hime...

20:21.320 --> 20:26.530
My goodness, what could have happened
to make the mansion this messy?

20:27.990 --> 20:32.660
Hey, Hiro, what happened? Wake up!

20:39.230 --> 20:43.800
Sherwood, thanks to the medicine you provided,
I'm fully recovered.

20:43.800 --> 20:45.140
I'm very grateful.

20:45.140 --> 20:47.740
Well that's good to hear, Sis.

20:47.740 --> 20:52.690
But I was nervous when you fell asleep
in the middle of battle.

20:56.650 --> 21:01.650
Damn, we didn't get them all?
Those persistent bastards!

21:01.660 --> 21:05.130
Oh, good morning, Mistress.

21:05.360 --> 21:09.900
My, Sherwood is here as well

21:10.660 --> 21:13.670
Oh, it's Sawawa.

21:13.670 --> 21:15.900
What's the meaning of this, Hiro?

21:15.900 --> 21:18.970
Why did you wrap me up like that?

21:18.970 --> 21:21.270
Explain yourself!

21:21.280 --> 21:23.880
Well, you see...

21:25.550 --> 21:28.280
I have to get to school or I'll be late!

21:28.280 --> 21:29.650
I'm off!

21:29.650 --> 21:31.890
Be careful, Hiro!

21:34.560 --> 21:38.060
It seems Sawawa is fully recovered
from her cold as well.

21:38.060 --> 21:39.700
Yeah...

21:42.730 --> 21:47.080
I can't tell her what happened last night.

21:56.040 --> 21:57.680
Hime...

21:58.350 --> 22:02.950
I was doing everything
in my power to protect her.

22:02.950 --> 22:05.920
But I'm happy-

22:05.920 --> 22:10.490
I finally feel like I was able to help her out.

23:41.080 --> 23:42.080
Huga.

23:42.080 --> 23:44.250
Hmm, where are we?

23:44.250 --> 23:47.320
Hime, this village isn't on the map.

23:47.320 --> 23:50.100
So, we're trapped in a village that doesn't exist.

23:50.720 --> 23:52.690
It's almost like a ghost story.

23:52.690 --> 23:54.360
Something doesn't feel right.

23:54.360 --> 23:56.700
It sends chills down my spine.

23:56.700 --> 23:58.970
Dun dun dun...

23:58.970 --> 24:00.870
Next episode, "Princess Sacrifice"

24:00.870 --> 24:03.440
Just make sure we're not the ones sacrificed!

24:04.040 --> 24:07.410
I don't think I've ever felt a chill
like this before, Hiro.

24:08.710 --> 24:10.280
Huga.
